Hi, Ian,

Thanks for your great work on this project. I really like it. As a
long/old time R user, using Deducer helps me to actually start to
learn ggplot2 by using the Plot builder. And I'm considering to
suggest Deducer to some of the colleagues as an alternative to
Statistica.

I hope I didn't miss the obvious. but a few features would help a lot
in my limited experience using Deducer.

1) it is helpful for me to be able to have a subset textbox in the
plot builder, similar to the "subset" in analysis dialogs already.

2a) The "Factor Editor" is not listing empty strings if it's one of
